        <mxCell id="scope-note" value="DESIGN_PENDING_RUNTIME. Proposed interactions and technical DTO limits, not an existing deployed endpoint, provider acceptance or approved missing business policy. Every mutation rechecks current session/role/CSRF; user-supplied actor/state is ignored. External delivery/transfer is outside database transactions. Actual reception, Customer surcharge consent, no-show and assignment are separate decisions. Declined surcharge is not imposed. Any no-charge/cancellation/no-show treatment is a proposed approved-policy gate, not a live financial action." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
